description	"The Hero

Based on Open Mode's hero class, given a complete set of weapons and attributes, plus added health and a few other goodies.

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (3)
- Blaster Rifle (3)
- 3 Frag Grenades
- Projectile Rifle
- Stun Baton (2)

^6Equiqment:
- Medpac (25HP+)

^8Attributes:
- Strength (1)
- Heal (3)
- CTF: 30s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (2) ^3[CS3]

^2Strengths^7: All Around strong class, with a healthy mix of weapons for a wide variety of ranges, with good protection and good mobility 
^1Weaknesses^7: As a generalist class, this class can be outperformed by specialist classes when said said specialist's strengths are played to."